#DESCRIPTION
Multi-face wave injection on a 2x2-block non-periodic 2D grid with reversed
face order (y-hi listed before x-hi in WAVEBC) and opposite-sign mode tables:
y-hi injects +Bz (+1 nT) and +uz (+20 km/s); x-hi injects -Bz (-1 nT) and
-uz (-20 km/s). Tests that: (1) interior block boundaries and non-wave faces
(x-lo, y-lo) remain unperturbed; (2) each wave face applies only its own modes;
(3) the (x-hi, y-hi) ghost corner selects y-hi (the first matching face in
WAVEBC input order) consistently for both fields and particle velocity kicks.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI
3.0e6                   uNormSI

#GEOMETRY
0.0                     xMin
16.0                    xMax
0.0                     yMin
16.0                    yMax
-0.5                    zMin
0.5                     zMax

#NCELL
16                      nCellX
16                      nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
8                       maxBlockSizeX
8                       maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
F                       isPeriodicX
F                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#PLASMA
2                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass
1.0                     charge
1.0/25.0                mass
-1.0                    charge

#FIELDBOXBOUNDARY
outflow                 fieldBoxBoundaryLo
wave                    fieldBoxBoundaryHi
outflow                 fieldBoxBoundaryLo
wave                    fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi

#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
outflow                 particleBoxBoundaryLo
coupled                 particleBoxBoundaryHi
